- Put variables in an `.envrc`; they load when you `cd` into the directory and unload when you leave
- `direnv allow` — trust the `.envrc` in the current directory (required again after it changes)
- `direnv deny` — revoke that trust
- `direnv edit` — edit the `.envrc` and trust it afterwards
- `direnv reload` — reload the environment
- `direnv status` — show debug information
{{ if .Options.log_format -}}
- Log messages use the format `{{ .Options.log_format }}` (`DIRENV_LOG_FORMAT`)
{{ end -}}
